WEBVTT

00:06:00.204 --> 00:06:02.954
Back on Highway 1,
I envisioned what awaited.

00:06:03.579 --> 00:06:05.121
Abed would hug me.

00:06:05.454 --> 00:06:07.121
Abed would spit at me.

00:06:07.871 --> 00:06:10.371
Abed would say, "I'm sorry."

00:06:11.621 --> 00:06:14.621
I then began to wonder,
as I had many times before,

00:06:14.663 --> 00:06:17.788
how my life would have been different
had this man not injured me,

00:06:17.829 --> 00:06:20.496
had my genes been fed
a different helping of experience.

00:06:21.121 --> 00:06:22.871
Who was I?

00:06:23.621 --> 00:06:25.996
Was I who I had been before the crash,

00:06:25.996 --> 00:06:29.579
before this road divided my life
like the spine of an open book?